# The deployed browser model is the exception to the weights rules above. GitHub Pages
# serves web/ as static files, so the .onnx the site loads has to be committed; it is
# quantised to about 10 MB for exactly that reason. Everything else stays ignored.
!web/models/*.onnx
!web/models/manifest.json
# Written by tests/test_web.mjs on every run and uploaded as a CI artifact.
# It is evidence of one run, not a document, so it does not belong in the tree.
docs/web-app.png

# Android build output. The wrapper jar IS tracked (it is how anyone reproduces the build
# without matching Gradle versions by hand); the local SDK pointer and the outputs are not.
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
*.apk
*.aab
*.jks
*.keystore
